{"type":"assistant","uuid":"0d326085-9613-47ac-bb02-f7d6d70d5565","session_id":"dfe942c0-6f99-481a-b2f4-32f343490ac6","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"0d326085-9613-47ac-bb02-f7d6d70d5565","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"qwen/qwen3.6-35b-a3b","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fix is complete. Here's a summary:\n\n**Root cause:** In `TowerInserter.buyTower()`, the method called `mScoreBoard.takeCredits()` without first checking whether the player had sufficient credits, allowing the balance to go negative.\n\n**Fix:** Added a guard check before the credit deduction. If `mScoreBoard.getCredits() < mInsertedTower.getValue()`, the method calls `cancel()` to discard the preview tower and returns early, preventing the placement.\n\n**Change:** One file modified — `app/src/main/java/ch/logixisland/anuto/business/control/TowerInserter.java`:\n- Added a credits affordability check at the top of `buyTower()` before any state mutations occur."}],"stop_reason":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":27921,"output_tokens":335,"cache_read_input_tokens":27456,"total_tokens":28256}}}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","uuid":"45215e0f-8a1d-49a8-90ff-403513689cdd","session_id":"dfe942c0-6f99-481a-b2f4-32f343490ac6","is_error":false,"duration_ms":98218,"duration_api_ms":41144,"num_turns":3,"result":"The fix is complete. Here's a summary:\n\n**Root cause:** In `TowerInserter.buyTower()`, the method called `mScoreBoard.takeCredits()` without first checking whether the player had sufficient credits, allowing the balance to go negative.\n\n**Fix:** Added a guard check before the credit deduction. If `mScoreBoard.getCredits() < mInsertedTower.getValue()`, the method calls `cancel()` to discard the preview tower and returns early, preventing the placement.\n\n**Change:** One file modified — `app/src/main/java/ch/logixisland/anuto/business/control/TowerInserter.java`:\n- Added a credits affordability check at the top of `buyTower()` before any state mutations occur.","usage":{"input_tokens":314640,"output_tokens":6308,"cache_read_input_tokens":222816,"total_tokens":320948},"permission_denials":[]}
